# Growza Core Standards

- Read existing code structure before writing new code; reuse components and utilities (DRY).
- No file may exceed **200 lines**; split into smaller focused files when approaching the limit.
- **Mobile-first** responsive design; test layouts from smallest breakpoint up.
- Prefer **Server Components** by default; add `"use client"` only when interactivity requires it.
- Lazy-load heavy client widgets with `dynamic(() => import(...), { ssr: false })`.
- Use `next/image` for all images with explicit dimensions to prevent layout shift.
- Framer Motion: use `whileInView` + `viewport={{ once: true }}` for scroll animations.
- Respect `prefers-reduced-motion` in CSS and animation components.
- Use semantic React component names (e.g. `HeroSection`, `GlowCard`, `StatsCounter`).
